 "text": "Hi, how have you been? That's a lot of people. Make a date, time, and location clear to everyone well in advance, and send out reminders. August is busy. Do you want to book the whole day, so no one has to leave early, or just few hours? Not necessarily. A few main courses is enough, with plenty of snacks and drinks. Would you rather cook or out? That's a win. Ask her now so she doesn't feel like she has to cook the whole thing. Tell people to book in small groups, so it's not one person staying up all night.",
